    "updated_at": "2021-10-01T09:00:06Z",
    "body": "On the one hand this seems somewhat reasonable, but on the other hand we don't really want folks to use the `embed` and `object` elements going forward so I'm not sure why we'd invest in them. What reason do you have for using the `embed` element instead of `iframe`?",
