    "updated_at": "2021-11-11T17:39:45Z",
    "body": "Since there seems to be broad consensus here to not add a `contentWindow` getter to `<embed>` elements, we won't go in that direction.\r\n\r\nIn the WECG we have decided to not add an extension-only `embed.contentWindow` getter, but let the proposed `getFrameId` API accept `HTMLEmbedElement` instances in addition to `WindowProxy` types.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
